Inferno OpenWrt experimental source port
Prepared: 2026-11-09

This archive contains an OpenWrt packaging overlay, a replacement capture frontend,
source transformation/preparation tools, tests, and documentation. It does not
contain the complete Inferno/Statime source trees, vendored crates or binaries.

